  "known_mutual_boundary": {
    "explicit_parents": "The current graph maps all unit IDs and explicit parent dependencies, including definition-to-definition edges. Existing mixed explicit-cycle controls are retained.",
    "implicit_names": "The current definition_uses contract restricts targets to norms, and the conflict key is target/path, not symbol globally. Unit signatures declare local symbols. Inferring which other definition owns a RHS symbol would require an additional applicability binding. The new check compares within the same verified signature only."
